&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the Business partner to GTM leaders; challenge the status quo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape &amp;amp; execute business strategy to address risks / obstacles / opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate strategy into actionable operational plans &amp;amp; execute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the Voice of sales in cross-functional initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute operational cadences at the Vertical/Segment level supporting a Regional VP of Sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage forecast and pipeline health; drive predictability for month/quarter/year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide business performance insights; facilitate decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce recurring &amp;amp; ad hoc exec business updates.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage &amp;amp; deliver on localized planning &amp;amp; sales ops activities (e.g. headcount, Annual Planning, New Year Readiness, Account Movements, Territory &amp;amp; Quota operationalization) in alignment with Strategic Operations peer function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
